00:46:52.600 --> 00:47:09.120
<v Ira Glass>All this bothered this sixth grader enough that he went to two different adults. One of them was his mom. And he didn't go into a lot of depth, but he told them this teacher is a creep, flirts with the girls in class. He's a pedo. And both adults were like, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Take a breath.
<v Ira Glass>所有这一切让这位六年级学生感到足够困扰，他去找了两个不同的成年人。其中一个是他的妈妈。他没深入讲，但他告诉他们这位老师是个变态，在班上调戏女生。他是个恋童癖。两个成年人都说，哇，哇，哇，哇，哇。先喘口气。

