00:47:18.500 --> 00:47:27.510
<v Ira Glass>He and his friends couldn't let it go, though. They'd talk about it when they'd hang out, when they were online playing Minecraft or Super Smash Brothers. It just seemed wrong.
<v Ira Glass>但他和朋友们无法放手。他们在一起玩《我的世界》或《超级马里奥兄弟》在线时会谈论它，也会开玩笑。这看起来就是不对劲。

00:47:27.510 --> 00:47:47.010
<v Ira Glass>And so, lacking any power to do anything else, they talked about it and joked about it. Finally, they decided to do the one thing you can do when you can't fix what's wrong with the world but still feel a strong sense of outrage. They became watchers. They decided to document everything the teacher did with the girls that seemed weird or inappropriate to them in a Discord channel they set up.
<v Ira Glass>所以，由于没有权力做任何其他事情，他们谈论它并开玩笑。最后，他们决定做一件事，当你无法解决世界上错误的事情但仍然感到强烈的愤怒时，你能做的一件事。他们成为了观察者。他们决定在他们设置的一个Discord频道中记录下老师对女孩所做的每一个看起来怪异或不恰当的事情。

