00:48:46.450 --> 00:48:56.500
<v Student>Like keeping dates, keeping times, keeping stuff logged on paper. And then we gave-- I gave an example of something he had said that day, and that's how it began.
<v Student>比如记录日期，记录时间，把东西记录在纸上。然后我们给出了——我给出了他那天说过的一个例子，这就是开始。

